EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}There's something about rainy days.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
They tend to bring out my wild side!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yağmur bana dilbilgisi öğretiyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mesela, "çizme"nin çoğulu "çizmeler"se,
iki çift olunca "çizmelerler" mi oluyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ha?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
